{:edb/db-before-t 165 :edb/db-after-t 166 :edb/tx-data [[13194139533478 50 #inst "2026-10-11T02:44:20.450Z" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186064279 1038 #edb/ref 17592186399432 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186064279 1038 #edb/ref 17592186399439 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186068906 1038 #edb/ref 17592186399391 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186078444 1038 #edb/ref 17592186399628 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186083251 1038 #edb/ref 17592186399621 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186087728 1038 #edb/ref 17592186399474 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186087730 1038 #edb/ref 17592186399398 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186087732 1038 #edb/ref 17592186399405 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186087828 1038 #edb/ref 17592186399356 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186096679 1038 #edb/ref 17592186399453 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186096712 1038 #edb/ref 17592186399502 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186096713 1038 #edb/ref 17592186399495 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186096751 1038 #edb/ref 17592186399572 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186096751 1038 #edb/ref 17592186399579 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186097356 1068 #edb/ref 17592186096030 13194139533478 17592186045585 false] [17592186097356 1068 #edb/ref 17592186399426 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186097356 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186097356 1071 "Consider the augmented matrix $M$ given by\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & 3 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 5 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 1 & 4 & 9\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nUse the standard method of Gaussian elimination to reduce the augmented matrix $M$ of the system to row echelon form." 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186097356 1071 "Consider the augmented matrix $M$ given by\n$M = \\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & 3 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 5 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 1 & 4 & 9\\end{bmatrix}$.\n\nUse the standard method of Gaussian elimination to reduce the augmented matrix $M$ of the system to row echelon form." 13194139533478 17592186045585 false] [17592186097356 1074 "Reducing $M$ to row echelon form, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & 3 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 5 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 1 & 4 & 9\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+(-1){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & 3 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 2 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 1 & 4 & 9\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+(-2){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & 3 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 2 & 2 \\\\ 0 & -3 & -2 & 7\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNote that we get ${a}_{22}=0.$ Therefore, we swap the $2$nd and $3$rd rows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & 3 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 2 & 2 \\\\ 0 & -3 & -2 & 7\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & ↔{R}_{3} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & 3 & 1 \\\\ 0 & -3 & -2 & 7 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 2 & 2\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we multiply the $2$nd row by $-\\frac{1}{3}$ and the $3$rd row by $\\frac{1}{2}$ to get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & 3 & 1 \\\\ 0 & -3 & -2 & 7 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 2 & 2\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :=-\\frac{1}{3}{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & 3 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & \\frac{2}{3} & -\\frac{7}{3} \\\\ 0 & 0 & 2 & 2\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{3} & :=\\frac{1}{2}{R}_{3} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & 3 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & \\frac{2}{3} & -\\frac{7}{3} \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 1\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186105751 1038 #edb/ref 17592186399488 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186105815 1038 #edb/ref 17592186399530 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186115305 1038 #edb/ref 17592186399586 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186119801 1038 #edb/ref 17592186399600 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186119801 1038 #edb/ref 17592186399607 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186119802 1038 #edb/ref 17592186399614 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [175921861